  os_intake | t | f | t
  os_reader | t | f | t
== Q4.3 pg_default_acl: every row whose role is one of the five, or whose grantee is (a row's absence means the built-in default: acldefault)
  os_owner | - | T | {os_owner=U/os_owner}
  os_owner | - | f | {os_owner=X/os_owner}
  os_owner | os | r | {os_reader=r/os_owner}
  postgres | public | r | {postgres=arwdDxtm/postgres,anon=Dxtm/postgres,authenticated=Dxtm/postgres,service_role=Dxtm/postgres,os_reader=r/postgres}
